I create documents in Word and Power Point in referencing to problems that I have encountered during trouble shooting a situation for
other's in my group in case they have similar situations or problems and put them in our group shared location on the network for all to read.
I also have done short training on things that I have encountered or I had more knowledge than others in my group via OSC in sharing on
my conference calls.
